      <title>AI恐慌蔓延 游戏开发商被迫自证预告片为真人实拍制作</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/geek001/post/20260906/AI%E6%81%90%E6%85%8C%E8%94%93%E5%BB%B6-%E6%B8%B8%E6%88%8F%E5%BC%80%E5%8F%91%E5%95%86%E8%A2%AB%E8%BF%AB%E8%87%AA%E8%AF%81%E9%A2%84%E5%91%8A%E7%89%87%E4%B8%BA%E7%9C%9F%E4%BA%BA%E5%AE%9E%E6%8B%8D%E5%88%B6%E4%BD%9C/</link>
